## Title: |cEECA2AFavorite Guild Cycler|r
## Description: Rotates your represented guild through selected favorites, remembers favorite guild identities and settings, and keeps the native Guild menu keybinds untouched. Minimum 1-second cycle interval is enforced to respect ESO's represented-guild API rate limit; sub-second cycling is disabled to reduce Error 318/rate-limit risk.
## Author: FavoriteGuildCyclerDev
## Version: 1.3.1
## AddOnVersion: 131
## APIVersion: 101051 101050 101049 101048
## IsConsoleOnly: false
